<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for S. Minn. Muni Power Agency.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for S. Minn. Muni Power Agency.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it has limited capacity in Southern Minnesota Municipal Power Agency on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to $15 million per firm. Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
